          "_name": "article06",
          "_sourceTheme": "devm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article6\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Icons\" name=\"icons\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showsubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Links\" name=\"showlinks\" min=\"0\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header condition=\"showsubTitle\">Color</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Subtitle Line\" name=\"subline\" value=\"#d4ceff\" selected condition=\"showsubTitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card\" name=\"row\" value=\"#f7f9fc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Hover\" name=\"rowhover\" value=\"#fbff87\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-wrap justify-content-center mb-5\" mbr-if=\"icons > 0\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-code mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"icons > 0\"></span>\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-contact-form mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"icons > 1\"></span>\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-desktop mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"icons > 2\"></span>\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-features mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"icons > 3\"></span>\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-cash mobi-mbri\" mbr-if=\"icons > 4\"></span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"subtitle-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\">\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .subtitle-wrap\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\"><b>Our Features</b></h2>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Vai deixar o bonde passar?</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">O mercado de ensino de idiomas online irá ultrapassar US$ 28,5 bilhões até 2028 (Fonte: Facts and Factors e Meticulous Research); e o crescimento anual previsto é de 20%.<br><br>Depois da pandemia, os estudantes de todo o mundo passaram a preferir aulas online. É um ótimo momento para receber em moedas mais valorizadas que o real, como o dólar e o euro.<br></p>\n\n                    <div class=\"link-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"link mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showlinks > 0\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-linkiconfont mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-link mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-link\"><b>\n                                    Read More Info</b></p>\n\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"link mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showlinks > 1\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-linkiconfont mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-link mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-link\"><b>\n                                    Get Started</b></p>\n\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"link\" mbr-if=\"showlinks > 2\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-linkiconfont mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-link mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-link\"><b>\n                                    More Info</b></p>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
